   180 				; VBXE_SetPalette2 - sets palette
   181 				;	A			- palette number
   182 				;	Y_Register	- palette pointer - Data MUST be page aligned
   183 				; NOTE: This code can run from ROM
   184 				;       The palette is stored as 256 RGB triplets
   185 				; NOTE (__VBXE_AUTO__ mode): the CR/CG/CB stores below use plain sta.w, not
   186 				; vbsta - this loop needs Y as its data index every iteration, and vbsta's
   187 				; (VBXEBase),Y addressing would clobber it every store. Instead the high
   188 				; byte of all nine store operands is patched ONCE per call (self-modifying,
   189 				; but off the hot path) so the loop itself runs at plain absolute-store cost.
   190 3159			VBXE_SetPalette2
   191 3159				vbsta VBXE_PSEL						; Set Palette 1
